Package: SigBenchR
Title: Gene Signature Benchmarking for Immunotherapy Response
Version: 0.4.5
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Efe Kaan", family = "Şengönül",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "fperskaan@gmail.com")
Description: Statistically validates whether a gene signature predicts
    immunotherapy response across multiple datasets in a reproducible way.
    Core computations are independent of Shiny; an optional web UI is provided
    via run_app().
